---
// 404 Fallback - Undangan Pernikahan Nabil & Izza
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Halaman Tidak Ditemukan · Nabil &amp; Izza</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --wine-950: #1b040b;
    --wine-900: #2c0712;
    --gold: #c9a56b;
    --gold-soft: #e6d2a6;
    --ivory: #f8f0e4;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%, #3a0916 0%, #1b040b 70%, #0d0105 100%);
    color: var(--ivory);
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 460px;
    background: rgba(44, 7, 18, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 165, 107, 0.35);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 36px);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .seal {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 3.2rem);
    color: var(--gold-soft);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(248, 240, 228, 0.85);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c9a56b 0%, #9e7d44 100%);
    color: #1b040b;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 99px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(201, 165, 107, 0.4);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="seal">N &amp; I</div>
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>Halaman yang Anda tuju tidak ditemukan. Silakan kembali ke halaman utama undangan pernikahan.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">
      <span>Buka Undangan Nabil &amp; Izza</span>
      <span>&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
